# Local environment overrides for the reference-delivery example.
#
# Copy to secrets/.env (gitignored) only when this machine needs non-default
# binary paths. The demo's coding agent talks to a deterministic local jig LLM
# launched by run.sh, so no real provider credentials are required.
#
# Forgejo role tokens/passwords are minted by run.sh into secrets/credentials.toml
# (gitignored, 0600) — the runtime's own credentials format, loaded via
# `temper daemon --secrets`; they are NOT pasted here.

# --- Local binary overrides (optional) ---------------------------------------
# TEMPER_FORGEJO_BINARY=/absolute/path/to/forgejo-7.0.12-linux-amd64
# TEMPER_FORGEJO_RUNNER_BINARY=/absolute/path/to/forgejo-runner-3.5.1-linux-amd64
# TEMPER_RUN_BIN=/absolute/path/to/temper
# TEMPER_JIG_REPO=/absolute/path/to/jig-checkout
# TEMPER_JIG_BIN=/absolute/path/to/jig
# TEMPER_REFERENCE_DELIVERY_JIG_FIXTURE=/absolute/path/to/reference-delivery.json
